{
  "defaults": {
    "megapixels": 0.4,
    "sampler_name": "res_multistep",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "steps": 4
  },
  "description": "Workflow for MiniMax H3 video to video (the source video as a reference) with native stereo sound (4-step Turbo LoRA)",
  "groups": [{
    "id": 1,
    "member_nodes": ["10", "11", "12", "13", "note:1"],
    "title": "Model Loaders"
  }, {
    "id": 2,
    "member_nodes": ["14", "note:2"],
    "title": "Turbo LoRA"
  }, {
    "id": 3,
    "member_nodes": ["2", "4", "6", "7", "note:3"],
    "title": "Reference Video"
  }],
  "name": "MiniMax H3 (Turbo LoRA)",
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Video"
      },
      "class_type": "LoadVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "file": "source_upload.mp4 [input]"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      },
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "unet.safetensors",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      }
    },
    "100": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "main_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "strength_model": 0.800000011920929
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Text Encoder"
      },
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "clip.safetensors",
        "device": "default",
        "type": "minimax"
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Video VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Audio VAE"
      },
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "audio_vae.safetensors"
      }
    },
    "14": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Turbo LoRA"
      },
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "lora_name": "mandatory_lora.safetensors",
        "model": ["100", 0],
        "strength_model": 1
      }
    },
    "2": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Up to 15 Seconds"
      },
      "class_type": "Video Slice",
      "inputs": {
        "duration": 15,
        "start_time": 0,
        "strict_duration": false,
        "video": ["1", 0]
      }
    },
    "20": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Noise"
      },
      "class_type": "RandomNoise",
      "inputs": {
        "noise_seed": "1234567890123"
      }
    },
    "21": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Guider"
      },
      "class_type": "BasicGuider",
      "inputs": {
        "conditioning": ["7", 0],
        "model": ["14", 0]
      }
    },
    "22": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sampler"
      },
      "class_type": "KSamplerSelect",
      "inputs": {
        "sampler_name": "dpmpp_2m"
      }
    },
    "23": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scheduler"
      },
      "class_type": "BasicScheduler",
      "inputs": {
        "denoise": 1,
        "model": ["14", 0],
        "scheduler": "karras",
        "steps": "28"
      }
    },
    "24": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sample"
      },
      "class_type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "guider": ["21", 0],
        "latent_image": ["7", 1],
        "noise": ["20", 0],
        "sampler": ["22", 0],
        "sigmas": ["23", 0]
      }
    },
    "25": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Video"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0]
      }
    },
    "26": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Audio"
      },
      "class_type": "VAEDecodeAudio",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["13", 0]
      }
    },
    "27": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      },
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "audio": ["26", 0],
        "fps": 24,
        "images": ["25", 0]
      }
    },
    "28": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      },
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "codec": "auto",
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "video": ["27", 0]
      }
    },
    "3": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Get Video Components"
      },
      "class_type": "GetVideoComponents",
      "inputs": {
        "video": ["2", 0]
      }
    },
    "4": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scale to Megapixels"
      },
      "class_type": "ImageScaleToTotalPixels",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["3", 0],
        "megapixels": "1.5",
        "resolution_steps": 32,
        "upscale_method": "lanczos"
      }
    },
    "5": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Video Size"
      },
      "class_type": "GetImageSize",
      "inputs": {
        "image": ["4", 0]
      }
    },
    "6": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Source Length at 24 fps"
      },
      "class_type": "ComfyMathExpression",
      "inputs": {
        "expression": "max(5, round(a / b * 24)) + (5 - (max(5, round(a / b * 24)) % 17)) % 17",
        "values.a": ["5", 2],
        "values.b": ["3", 2]
      }
    },
    "7": {
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Reference to Video"
      },
      "class_type": "MiniMaxH3ReferenceToVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "audio_vae": ["13", 0],
        "clip": ["11", 0],
        "height": ["5", 1],
        "length": ["6", 1],
        "prompt": "A \"red\" fox\nin snow \\ test",
        "ref_image_size": "match",
        "ref_video_audios.ref_video_audio_0": ["3", 1],
        "ref_videos.ref_video_0": ["4", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0],
        "width": ["5", 0]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": [{
    "content": "### Recommended Models\n\n- **Diffusion model:** **MiniMax H3 REF2VA** (reference to video, Int8)\n- **Text encoder:** **Qwen3-VL 32B** for MiniMax H3 (NVFP4 AWQ)\n- **VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **video** VAE\n- **Audio VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **audio** VAE\n\n---\n\n*MiniMax H3 generates the picture and its stereo sound together, at 24 fps.*",
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Model Selection"
  }, {
    "content": "### Recommended LoRA\n\nUse **REF2V Turbo 4-step** at strength 1.0.\n\n- **Steps:** 4\n- **Sampler:** res_multistep\n- **Scheduler:** simple",
    "id": 2,
    "title": "Turbo LoRA"
  }, {
    "content": "### How It Works\n\nThe source video (its first 15 seconds, with its sound) is a **reference**: the result follows its content, motion and camera, but isn't converted frame by frame.\n\n- Refer to it in the prompt as **<Video 1>**, e.g. *The same scene as <Video 1>, restyled as a watercolor painting.*\n- The result is as long as the source and keeps its aspect ratio.\n- **Megapixels:** 0.4 for speed, up to ~1.0 (768p)\n\n---\n\n*Sources at 24 fps work best: other frame rates are read as 24 fps. Sources shorter than 2 seconds aren't supported.*",
    "id": 3,
    "title": "Reference Video"
  }]
}
